<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "システム音\The_Lampe.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\イラスト\立木三日2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "300" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "プレート" "グラフィック\システム\立木三日プレート.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "180" "380" "600" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\イラスト\立木三日.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Thank you for your hard work, <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama. You have reached the first <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="しゅうえん">demise</STYLE>.<PG>
It was so sudden that you must have been quite surprised, but this is the ending that they themselves chose from among every choice.<PG>
Of course, I do not think they wished for such an ending on purpose, but no one exists in this world who can choose every future.<PG>
However, with what Erina Goto realized at the end also left undisclosed, from here on only despair awaits, no matter what.<PG>
Then, where, and what sort of choice, would have let them meet a different ending? 
{PAUSE ""}
In this world, you are permitted to see such 'what if' worlds.<PG>
In fact, did you notice that there were several branching points in the scenarios <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama has viewed so far?
{PAUSE ""}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="NOREPAGE">
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
